<<<
To take an example or two: it is hard to see why necessarian & necessitarian, or hydrocephalic & hydrocephalous, should coexist & puzzle us to no purpose by coexisting; but correctitude by the side of correctness had once, if it has not now, a real value,
===
To take an example or two: it is hard to see why *necessarian & necessitarian,* or *hydrocephalic & hydrocephalous,* should coexist & puzzle us to no purpose by coexisting; but *correctitude* by the side of *correctness* had once, if it has not now, a real value,
>>>

